79-7f4bc815457c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd621404380ab42be7c1d8621d19e394 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。可能であれば全身を依頼したいです。私のVtuberのマギーの一人が欲しいです。彼女は2つの頭翼とドレスの内側から突き出た2つの翼を持っていて、彼女が身に着けているボアは、実は普段彼女が肩に巻いているだけの大きな翼のペアなのです。目はいつも半眼で、唇は大きい。マギーはとてもぽっちゃりしていて、背が低い。グラデーションはスタイルではなく、彼女のデザインに必要不可欠なものです。:0 参考資料と同じような顔の表情で、とてもエレガントなポーズを考えています。もし、背景にステンドグラスのようなものがあれば、それはとてもいいと思います。ご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EqQ_zV8AZIMXeE--QWri6CtcbItT6cLD", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_k16r4_/works/80", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5c232487/uploads/origins/204dc462-bbe1-446a-a462-71d75cf40242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2cd1987b1fb64cf57fd11c300b46f32c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5c232487/uploads/origins/204dc462-bbe1-446a-a462-71d75cf40242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2cd1987b1fb64cf57fd11c300b46f32c, https://si.imgix.net/5c232487/uploads/origins/204dc462-bbe1-446a-a462-71d75cf40242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47fd57130d81cd7601251adb4e169ba6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5c232487/uploads/origins/204dc462-bbe1-446a-a462-71d75cf40242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=498618436a45223ed4bd13b901779d97 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again! I would like for you to draw my character again, she is in an Autumn form this time! Genevieve is a very caring and sweet personality but is also very playful and mischievous! She is a Forest Nymph who has some deer-like features like antlers, freckles, darker nose tip, and darker upper lip. Please draw her in a forest setting in a pose of your choosing! Thank you!\nまたあったね！もう一度私のキャラクターを描いていただきたいのですが、今回は秋の姿です！ Genevieveはとても思いやりのある甘い性格ですが、とても遊び心があり、いたずら好きです！彼女は森のニンフで、枝角、そばかす、鼻先が暗く、上唇が暗くなるなど、鹿のような特徴があります。お好みのポーズで森の中に描いてください！ありがとう！\n\nhttps://twitter.com/RoscoeGenevieve/status/1450574893766959109", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_k16r4_/works/79", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0b505724/uploads/origins/95bad85a-6377-4feb-9bd3-4ea8928639e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea4c83c6a52da6b7f55b81579d4ed6b8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0b505724/uploads/origins/95bad85a-6377-4feb-9bd3-4ea8928639e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea4c83c6a52da6b7f55b81579d4ed6b8, https://si.imgix.net/0b505724/uploads/origins/95bad85a-6377-4feb-9bd3-4ea8928639e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a3befb560482453be877afc4bcd0508 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0b505724/uploads/origins/95bad85a-6377-4feb-9bd3-4ea8928639e5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6782017dfa85bf8cd0dd28d4644dad48 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, your art is super cute.\n\nI would like to have a drawing of my vtuber OC please. She's a \"sailor\" cat girl , passionates about plushies, moon and stars, she loves cute things.\nShe has a tanned skin, a fluffy tail and long pink hair and clouds in her ears. She's shy and and clumsy too.\n\nIt will be for Valentine's Day so could you draw her in a cute pose/expression and also a colorful background, holding a present (chocolate box or letter) with \"Happy Valentine's Day written please ? \nLike this \n- https://img5.goodfon.com/wallpaper/nbig/c/87/klass-party-stulia-den-sviatogo-valentina-devochka.jpg\n\nHere are more references : https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1trX_MHL5eu8d9m7pqoM8mRn66Uhutxsc?usp=sharing\n\nI will be using in on Twitter \n\nThank you for considering  !\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/2Vr0vIS", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}